        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。苏晴今天状态不错嘛。",
      "start": 10.113,
      "duration": 3.57,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "还行还行，主要今天有好多好玩的事儿想跟你聊。我跟你说，今天看到一组数据挺有意思，就是Google搞了一个AI编程课，35.3万人同时在学……35万！你想想这是什么概念？",
      "start": 14.18,
      "duration": 17.957,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这也太夸张了。35万人同时在线学习一门编程课，这个规模在历史上应该都是头一遭。",
      "start": 32.59,
      "duration": 7.488,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对！而且这门课不叫\"Python入门\"也不叫\"算法基础\"，它叫\"Vibe Coding\"。我第一次看到这个名字还以为是什么新出的音乐节",
      "start": 40.483,
      "duration": 11.189,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈哈，这个名字确实挺有意思。Vibe Coding说白了就是\"氛围编程\"，意思是你不用死记硬背那些语法和括号了，直接跟AI说\"我想做个什么\"，AI帮你把代码写出来。",
      "start": 52.105,
      "duration": 13.908,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦，所以就是\"动嘴写代码\"？",
      "start": 66.478,
      "duration": 3.222,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "可以这么理解。你注意啊，这个名字背后其实藏着一个巨大的转变——以前学编程，你得先啃变量、循环、函数这些基础概念；现在呢，你只需要把自己的意图讲清楚就行，语法层面的事AI全包了。",
      "start": 70.162,
      "duration": 15.257,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那我突然觉得有点慌，你说35万人都涌进去学这个，会不会以后\"程序员\"这个职业就彻底变味儿了？",
      "start": 85.87,
      "duration": 8.795,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我觉得不是职业消失，是职业分层更明显了。问题是你能不能把问题定义清楚，能不能理解系统的运行逻辑。单纯的码农确实会被替代，但懂业务、懂架构、能跟AI协作的人反而会更值钱。你想啊，35万人里真正能脱颖而出的一定是那批有想法、会表达的人。",
      "start": 95.165,
      "duration": 22.485,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你这么一说我心里就踏实点了。话说Google这场课为什么能搞到35万人？他们图什么呀？",
      "start": 118.088,
      "duration": 7.358,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说白了还是生态战。Google现在有Gemini模型，有一整套AI开发工具链，它需要把这套生态推广到大众开发者手里。你想啊，35万人哪怕只有十分之一变成活跃用户，这对Gemini的调用量、数据反馈都是天量级的。",
      "start": 125.907,
      "duration": 18.044,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "懂了，这跟我们当年看到铺天盖地的Android培训一个逻辑对吧？先把人拉进来，人进了生态，剩下的都好说。",
      "start": 144.396,
      "duration": 10.797,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "完全正确。而且更关键的是，Vibe Coding代表的是一种\"AI原生思维\"的普及。以后的开发者可能从小接触的就是\"我有个想法→跟AI一起实现\"，而不是\"我先学三年C语言→再学框架→才能开始干活\"。",
      "start": 155.667,
      "duration": 16.563,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这事儿对我们普通听众有啥影响？我又不是程序员。",
      "start": 172.657,
      "duration": 5.224,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "影响可大了。你想想，当35万人里哪怕有1%做出了自己的小工具，那涌出来的应用数量是海量的。咱们的手机里以后会冒出一大堆以前根本没人想到要做的小应用，因为开发门槛真的被砸下去了。",
      "start": 178.345,
      "duration": 16.694,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "行，这个我记下了。对了还有件事儿，今天头条上还有个特别值得聊的。",
      "start": 195.456,
      "duration": 5.921,
      "audios": {
