        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "就是Om AI那家中国团队搞出来的3B参数VLX模型是吧？",
      "start": 201.813,
      "duration": 5.79,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对！3B，30亿参数。你知道这个量级在以前只能算\"玩具模型\"，结果它居然在物理世界感知任务上把英伟达和谷歌的大体量方案都干翻了。",
      "start": 208.02,
      "duration": 15.369,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这件事的意义不在于\"小模型赢了\"，而在于它证明了——物理世界感知这件事，可能根本不需要那么大的参数堆。",
      "start": 223.885,
      "duration": 9.143,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你给我讲讲，它是怎么做到的？",
      "start": 233.44,
      "duration": 2.438,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "简单说，传统的大模型走的是\"通吃\"路线，啥数据都往里灌，参数自然就大。但Om AI这个团队换了个架构，它专门针对物理世界的视觉-语言-运动这一套逻辑做了端侧原生优化。换句话说，人家没在云端跟你拼算力，直接换了一条赛道。",
      "start": 236.357,
      "duration": 20.308,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦我明白了，这就是咱俩之前聊过的\"云端堆算力\"那条路走到头了对吧？",
      "start": 257.097,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，今天金句那句话其实就是这个意思——AI的重心正在从\"云端堆算力\"转向\"端侧懂物理\"。过去的范式是\"我模型越大我越牛\"，现在开始变成\"我模型再小，只要它在合适的场景下懂物理，就够了\"。",
      "start": 263.965,
      "duration": 17.086,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这个对我们生活有啥影响？",
      "start": 281.541,
      "duration": 3.918,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个可就太直接了。你想想具身智能机器人、自动驾驶、AR眼镜——这些场景全都受限于功耗和算力成本。一个3B的模型能跑得动，跟一个70B的模型只能跑在云端，这两个对硬件的要求天差地别。",
      "start": 285.936,
      "duration": 16.825,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以以后咱们的眼镜里可能就能塞进一个真正\"看得懂世界\"的AI了？",
      "start": 303.179,
      "duration": 5.79,
      "audios": {
