        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "怎么说？",
      "start": 330.098,
      "duration": 0.74,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你看哈，Vibe Coding是让普通人能\"动嘴做应用\"，3B模型是让AI能\"轻装上阵\"。合在一起就是AI真的开始渗透到普通人生活的每一个角落了——既不需要你懂代码，也不需要你有巨贵的硬件。",
      "start": 331.247,
      "duration": 19.524,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说得真好，这其实就是今天那个金句的另一个角度。架构在变，造物方式也在变。以前的AI是高高在上的庞然大物，现在开始变成你口袋里的工具、你眼镜里的感知器、你家里的小助手。",
      "start": 351.258,
      "duration": 14.212,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哎对了，你不说我都忘了，还有几个快讯要跟你过一下。",
